WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.413
Next, which cloud.

2
00:00:01.413 --> 00:00:06.384
This chapter talks to three hosts:
Microsoft Graph for app registrations and

3
00:00:06.384 --> 00:00:11.588
sign-ins, Resource Manager for managed
identities, and the sign-in host for tokens.

4
00:00:11.588 --> 00:00:15.041
The estate is a G C C tenant
with commercial Azure,

5
00:00:15.041 --> 00:00:17.976
so all three are the worldwide endpoints.

6
00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:22.102
G C C High and the Defense Department
clouds have their own hosts,

7
00:00:22.102 --> 00:00:24.438
and the code switches only for those.

8
00:00:24.438 --> 00:00:29.202
One gap worth knowing: the managed identity
pages the chapter read don't say whether

9
00:00:29.202 --> 00:00:31.411
they're available in Azure Government,

10
00:00:31.411 --> 00:00:34.920
which is fine here because this
estate's Azure is commercial.
